<title>USA: Courier sets $3.0 mln share buyback.</title>
<headline>Courier sets $3.0 mln share buyback.</headline>
<dateline>NORTH CHELMSFORD, Mass. 1996-11-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Courier Corp said on Monday that its board had authorized the buyback and retirement of common shares with an aggregate purchase price of up to $3.0 million during the next six months or so.</p>
<p>As of November 22, the company said it had 2,033,150 common shares outstanding.</p>
